# LF on every platform, Windows checkouts included. A CRLF install.sh makes sh
# read `set -eu\r` and stop with "set: Illegal option -"; the skill and command
# files duet installs are compared with what it ships, so they must not change
# underneath it either.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
